-- title:
--   First coordinate is a uniformiser where partial_YΦ̄≠ 0
-- statement:
--   Let $k$ be a field, let $N\ge 1$, and let `data` be a `ModularPolynomialData N`, that is: a polynomial $\Phi \in \mathbb{Z}[X][Y]$, monic in $Y$, of degree in $Y$ equal to $\psi(N)=\sum_{d\mid N,\ d\text{ squarefree}} N/d$, and satisfying $\Phi(\jmath_q,\jmath_{q,N})=0$ in the Laurent series field over $\mathbb{Q}$, where the coefficients in $\mathbb{Z}[X]$ are evaluated at the $q$-expansion $\jmath_q$ of $j$ and $Y$ at its $q^N$-substitution. Let $s,t\in k$ and assume that the reduction $\bar\Phi\in k[X][Y]$ of $\Phi$ along $\mathbb{Z}\to k$ satisfies $(\partial\bar\Phi/\partial Y)(s,t)\neq 0$, the derivative being taken in the outer variable $Y$ and evaluated by $X\mapsto s$, $Y\mapsto t$. Work inside $F=k(\tilde\jmath,\tilde\jmath_N)\subseteq k((q))$, the subfield of the Laurent series over $k$ generated by $\tilde\jmath = q^{-1}\cdot(E_4^3\,\eta^{-24}\bmod k)$ and its $q\mapsto q^N$ substitution $\tilde\jmath_N$. Let $P$ be a place of $F$ over $k$, i.e. a proper valuation subring of $F$ containing $k$ whose ideals are principal, with associated normalised integer-valued order function $\mathrm{ord}_P$. If $\mathrm{ord}_P(\tilde\jmath - s)>0$ and $\mathrm{ord}_P(\tilde\jmath_N - t)>0$, then $\mathrm{ord}_P(\tilde\jmath - s)=1$.
--
--   This is the statement that at a point $(s,t)$ of the affine plane model $\bar\Phi_N(X,Y)=0$ of the modular curve in characteristic $p$ (or $0$) where the partial derivative in the second variable does not vanish, the first coordinate $\tilde\jmath - s$ is a local parameter for any place centred at that point. Together with the corresponding uniqueness statement it feeds [`ModularCurve.exists_finset_forall_isCentreOf_unique_ord_eq_one`](thm.html#ModularCurve.exists_finset_forall_isCentreOf_unique_ord_eq_one), which produces a cofinite set of affine places of the level-$N$ modular function field that are unramified in the required sense.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_CharPModel_ord_sub_eq_one_of_derivative_evalEval_ne_zero.lean

